        "grants_authority": false,
        "clauses": [
          {
            "text": "- allowed: inspect git history, inspect staged, unstaged, branch, or committed diffs, and write review artifacts when asked\n- forbidden: applying fixes, modifying files, staging changes, silent approval, hidden execution, or claiming code quality is fine without reading the diff\n- escalation: if the change crosses into release risk, test gaps, or architecture risk, recommend `engos-quality-gitops-review`, `engos-quality-testing-review`, or `engos-design-architecture`",
